{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-details",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "<is-details>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente is-details de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-details",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-details>",
      "lede": "Disclosure colapsable: muestra un resumen y, al expandir, el contenido. Equivalente\r\n          accesible al <code class=\"code\">&lt;details&gt;</code> nativo, con apariencias,\r\n          iconos, animaciones y comportamiento de accordion opcional.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<span class=\"demo-label\">caso mínimo</span>\r\n          <is-details summary=\"¿Qué es InSoft?\">\r\n            InSoft es un ERP modular para empresas medianas que necesitan integrar\r\n            contabilidad, inventario, facturación y CRM en una sola plataforma.\r\n          </is-details>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"¿Qué es InSoft?\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n  InSoft es un ERP modular…\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "appearances",
      "title": "Apariencias",
      "lede": "El atributo <code class=\"code\">appearance</code> ajusta el fondo y borde.\r\n          Default: <code class=\"code\">outlined</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details variant=\"outlined\" summary=\"outlined\">Borde 1px, fondo transparente.</is-details>\r\n          <is-details variant=\"filled\" summary=\"filled\">Fondo elevado, sin borde.</is-details>\r\n          <is-details variant=\"filled-outlined\" summary=\"filled-outlined\">Fondo + borde.</is-details>\r\n          <is-details variant=\"plain\" summary=\"plain\">Sin fondo ni borde, solo espaciado.</is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">variant</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"filled\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "icon-placement",
      "title": "Posición del icono",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">icon-placement</code>: <code class=\"code\">start</code> o\r\n          <code class=\"code\">end</code>. Default: <code class=\"code\">end</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details icon-placement=\"end\" summary=\"icono al final (default)\">Contenido que se revela al hacer click.</is-details>\r\n          <is-details icon-placement=\"start\" summary=\"icono al inicio\">El chevron rota 180° al expandir y se ubica a la izquierda.</is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon-placement</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"start\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "custom-icons",
      "title": "Iconos custom",
      "lede": "Slots <code class=\"code\">expand-icon</code> y <code class=\"code\">collapse-icon</code>\r\n          para reemplazar el chevron por defecto.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details summary=\"Resumen con icono plus/minus\">\r\n            <is-icon slot=\"expand-icon\" icon=\"mdi:plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n            <is-icon slot=\"collapse-icon\" icon=\"mdi:minus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n            Al expandirse se muestra un signo menos; al colapsarse, un más.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n\r\n          <is-details summary=\"Pregunta frecuente\" icon-placement=\"start\">\r\n            <is-icon slot=\"expand-icon\" icon=\"mdi:help-circle-outline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n            <is-icon slot=\"collapse-icon\" icon=\"mdi:help-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n            Cambia el icono según el estado.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-icon</span> <span class=\"attr\">slot</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"expand-icon\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:plus\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span><span class=\"tag\"></is-icon></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-icon</span> <span class=\"attr\">slot</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"collapse-icon\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:minus\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span><span class=\"tag\"></is-icon></span>\r\n  Contenido…\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rich-summary",
      "title": "Summary rico (slot)",
      "lede": "En lugar del atributo <code class=\"code\">summary</code>, usa el slot\r\n          <code class=\"code\">summary</code> para contenido rico (iconos, badges, etc.).",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details>\r\n            <div slot=\"summary\">\r\n              <strong>Pedido #A-10293</strong>\r\n              <is-badge color=\"success\" variant=\"filled\" style=\"margin-left:.5em\">Enviado</is-badge>\r\n            </div>\r\n            Cliente: Distribuidora del Norte · Total: $1.245,00 · 3 ítems.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><div</span> <span class=\"attr\">slot</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"summary\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"tag\"><strong></span>Pedido #A-10293<span class=\"tag\"></strong></span>\r\n    <span class=\"tag\"><is-badge</span> <span class=\"attr\">color</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"success\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Enviado<span class=\"tag\"></is-badge></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"></div></span>\r\n  Cliente: …\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "accordion",
      "title": "Accordion (varios <code>name</code>)",
      "titleHtml": true,
      "lede": "Cuando varios <code class=\"code\">is-details</code> comparten el atributo\r\n          <code class=\"code\">name</code>, abrir uno cierra los demás.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details name=\"faq\" summary=\"¿Cómo cambio de plan?\">\r\n            Ve a Configuración → Plan y elige el nuevo plan. El cambio se aplica al final del ciclo.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n          <is-details name=\"faq\" summary=\"¿Puedo exportar mis datos?\">\r\n            Sí. En Configuración → Datos encontrarás exports en CSV, JSON y Excel.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n          <is-details name=\"faq\" summary=\"¿Cómo cancelo la cuenta?\">\r\n            Puedes cancelar desde Configuración → Plan → Cancelar. Mantienes acceso hasta el fin del ciclo.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"faq\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"faq\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "states",
      "title": "Estados",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">open</code> para abrir por defecto; <code class=\"code\">disabled</code>\r\n          bloquea la interacción.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-details open summary=\"Empieza abierto por defecto\">\r\n            El atributo <code class=\"code\">open</code> lo deja expandido desde el primer render.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n          <is-details disabled summary=\"Bloqueado (no se puede expandir)\">\r\n            El atributo <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> desactiva el toggle.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">open</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">disabled</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"…\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "methods",
      "title": "API JavaScript",
      "lede": "Métodos: <code class=\"code\">show()</code>, <code class=\"code\">hide()</code>,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">toggle()</code>. Propiedades: <code class=\"code\">open</code>,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">summary</code>, <code class=\"code\">name</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-details id=\"apiDetails\" summary=\"Demo controlada\">\r\n            Esto lo abro y cierro desde los botones de abajo.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n          <div class=\"card-row-actions\" style=\"margin-top:.5em\">\r\n            <is-button id=\"btnOpen\">show()</is-button>\r\n            <is-button id=\"btnClose\">hide()</is-button>\r\n            <is-button id=\"btnToggle\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle()</is-button>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-details</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"apiDetails\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">summary</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Demo\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-details></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"><script></span>\r\n  document.getElementById('btnOpen').onclick  = () => document.getElementById('apiDetails').show();\r\n  document.getElementById('btnClose').onclick = () => document.getElementById('apiDetails').hide();\r\n  document.getElementById('btnToggle').onclick = () => document.getElementById('apiDetails').toggle();\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></script></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "events",
      "title": "Eventos",
      "lede": "Burbujean y son <code class=\"code\">composed: true</code>: <code class=\"code\">is-show</code>,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">is-after-show</code>, <code class=\"code\">is-hide</code>,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">is-after-hide</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-details id=\"evtDetails\" summary=\"Pulsa y mira la consola\">\r\n            El evento <code class=\"code\">is-after-show</code> se dispara tras la animación de apertura.\r\n          </is-details>\r\n          <div id=\"evtLog\" class=\"callout\" style=\"margin-top:.5em\">Log:</div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "document.getElementById('evtDetails').addEventListener('is-after-show', () => {\r\n  console.log('abierto');\r\n});",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
